guide forever/reputation/orgrimmar
title Orgrimmar Reputation
category Reputation
folder Reputation · Cities
faction Horde
levels 12-60
zone Orgrimmar
keywords Orgrimmar, Rashona Straglash, cloth quartermaster, cloth donation, Runecloth, Additional Runecloth, Wool, Silk, Mageweave, Wild Guardians, Betrayed, Valley of Trials, Razor Hill, Sen'jin Village, Crossroads, Hidden Enemies, Chen's Empty Keg, Brewmaster Drohn, wolf mount, Ogunaro Wolfrunner
reward text Exalted with Orgrimmar
reward item 18796
why Level 56-60 quests and Runecloth to Exalted, with the old Durotar quests as a fast extra if they still pay in full.

# Built from Forever's quest data: every quest that pays Orgrimmar reputation,
# with the value from Forever's own quest pages, the world database (quest
# chains, the cloth quests' exclusive group, Additional
# Runecloth's repeat flag), quests.json, npcs.json, items.json and the quest
# notes for givers, objectives, drops and places, and the Forever client's
# Faction and ItemSparse tables.
# Numbers (Forever's quest pages): A Donation of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and
# Runecloth 150 each (60 cloth); Additional Runecloth 50 for 20 Runecloth (the
# same as Classic Era).
# Starting standing (Faction table): Orc Friendly 1000; Tauren and Troll
# Friendly 100; Undead and Skyborne Neutral 2000. No race has a reputation
# bonus. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds 2% a rank, 10% at 5/5: the numbers here
# leave it out. City reputation also gives a quarter to the other Horde
# cities (Faction table: parent Horde, 0.25), except starting-zone quests.
# Low-level quests: in Classic a quest 6 or more levels below you pays less, a
# fifth at 60; quests of level 55 and up pay in full at 60. The level 56-60
# quests come first for that reason. The old hubs are optional steps (the
# first step of each carries a label; skipping it skips the hub), ranked by
# reputation per minute at full value with the fifth beside it.
# INGAME: grey-quest reputation at 60 (Classic: a fifth from 9 levels below; one Forever beta report: full, quest 456 at level 30 paid 100)
# INGAME: reputation discounts in Forever (Classic: 10% at Honored with the city's merchants; Forever guide sites report 5/10/15/20% from Friendly to Exalted, one says not announced)
# Left out: class letters and race-only breadcrumbs, Alterac Valley quests
# (Alterac Valley guide), Commendation Signets (only from the Ahn'Qiraj war
# effort), Threat from Below (175 for six trips), Need for a Cure (a long
# chain), A Pain in the Neck (needs Disenchant), Beasts of Thunder Ridge
# (needs crafted Cured Light Hide), Consumed by Hatred (60 tusks).
# Mounts: the client lets every Horde race ride every Horde mount and puts no
# reputation gate on them.
# ASSUMED: another race's wolves need Exalted with Orgrimmar (Classic rule; Forever's client puts no reputation gate on the items, so the vendor decides). In-game check: a non-orc below Exalted at Ogunaro Wolfrunner.

step Orgrimmar: how it works
  tip Orgrimmar reputation comes from quests and cloth. Rashona Straglash, the cloth quartermaster, stands in the Drag beside the cloth and leather armor shop. She takes four one-time donations of 60 cloth (150 each) and then Additional Runecloth, 20 Runecloth for 50, as often as you like. Every point you earn with Orgrimmar also gives a quarter as much to Thunder Bluff, the Undercity and the Darkspear Trolls. While you level, do Orgrimmar's quests within 5 levels of them: Durotar at 5 to 12, the Crossroads at 12 to 20, Thrall's Hidden Enemies at 12 to 16. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10%. Rewards: at Honored Orgrimmar's merchants sell to you for 10% less (the Classic rule), the wolf vendor included; at Exalted other races can buy the wolves: 20 gold for a level 40 wolf, 200 gold for a swift wolf at level 60, once you have mount training. Orgrimmar has no tabard or other reward.
  accept 7826                         -- Rashona Straglash: A Donation of Wool, +150

step Bloodvenom Post: Wild Guardians
  zone Felwood
  tip These quests are level 56 to 59, so they pay in full at 60. Trull Failbane stands at Bloodvenom Post; the owlbeasts live in Winterspring, through the Timbermaw tunnel north of Felwood.
  level 55
  accept 4521                         -- Wild Guardians, +100

