  zone Winterspring
  tip Raging Owlbeasts north-west of Everlook, Ragged Owlbeasts further west.
  kill 7451 x15 quest 4521.1          -- Raging Owlbeast
  kill 7450 x15 quest 4521.2          -- Ragged Owlbeast

