step Belgrom Rockmaul: Betrayed
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Belgrom stands in the Valley of Honor outside the Hall of the Brave. The first two Betrayed quests are level 53 and pay a little less at 60 (in Classic 30 and 45); the last two pay in full.
  accept 3504                         -- Betrayed, +50

step Valormok
  zone Azshara
  tip Fly to Valormok in western Azshara. Ag'tor Bloodfist sends you north-east to the blood elf camp on the bluffs of the northern peninsula.
  turnin 3504                         -- Ag'tor Bloodfist
  accept 3505                         -- Betrayed, +75

step Magus Rimtori's camp
  tip Kill the Reclaimers and Surveyors, then walk up to the book inside the ring of stone pillars. Read the Kaldorei Tome of Summoning there to start the next quest: break the crystals around the circle, kill the guard that comes, then Magus Rimtori.
  kill 6199 x10 quest 3505.1          -- Blood Elf Reclaimer
  kill 6198 x10 quest 3505.2          -- Blood Elf Surveyor
  complete 3505 @59.5,31.5            -- Find Magus Rimtori's camp
  turnin 3505                         -- the Kaldorei Tome of Summoning
  accept 3506                         -- Betrayed, +75
  collect 10597 quest 3506.1          -- Head of Magus Rimtori

step Valormok and Orgrimmar
  turnin 3506                         -- Ag'tor Bloodfist
  accept 3507                         -- Betrayed, +150
  turnin 3507                         -- Belgrom Rockmaul, in Orgrimmar
  note "Betrayed: 300 Orgrimmar reputation at 60."

step Blackrock Mountain, with a group
  zone Badlands
  tip Kargath in the Badlands hands out Orgrimmar quests for Blackrock Depths and Blackrock Spire, all level 58 to 60 and paid in full: Precarious Predicament and Operation: Death to Angerforge (150 each), The Pack Mistress and Bijou's Reconnaissance Report (100 each), Warlord's Command (150), Eitrigg's Wisdom (100) and For The Horde! (Rend's head, 200 to every Horde city). These are dungeon quests: take them when your group goes.
  accept 4903 optional                -- Warlord Goretooth: Warlord's Command, +150, a group of five
  accept 4724 optional                -- Galamav the Marksman: The Pack Mistress, +100, a group of five

step Valley of Trials (optional hub)
  label valley
  zone Durotar
  tip In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. The Valley of Trials is the best of them: about 1,400 Orgrimmar and 1,400 Darkspear reputation in 25 minutes (about 280 each at a fifth). Gornek waits in the Den, the big hut; Kaltunk stands outside it.
  accept 787                          -- Eitrigg, in Orgrimmar: The New Horde, +50
  turnin 787                          -- Gornek
  accept 4641                         -- Kaltunk: Your Place in the World, +50
