step Around the Crossroads
  when done crossroads
  tip The Razormane camps and the supply crates are north-east of the town; Chol'aruk, an elite boar, sits deep in the Thorn Hill cave there. The Witchwing harpies nest far to the north-west. The Beaten Corpse lies north-east of Camp Taurajo, in the south: right-click it. Raptors and plainstriders are everywhere.
