step Prowlers, Serena and Echeyakee
  when done crossroads
  tip Savannah Prowlers lie west and north of the Crossroads. Serena Bloodfeather leads the Witchwing harpies in the far north-west. Then Sergra gives you the Horn of Echeyakee: blow it beside the kodo bones at Echeyakee's Lair, north of the town, and kill the white lion.
  collect 5096 x7 quest 903.1         -- Prowler Claws
  collect 5067 quest 876.1            -- Serena's Head
  turnin 903
  accept 881                          -- Echeyakee, +150
  turnin 876
  collect 5100 quest 881.1            -- Echeyakee's Hide
  turnin 881                          -- Sergra Darkthorn

step Chen's Empty Keg (optional hub)
  label keg
  zone The Barrens
  tip In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip this. Chen's Empty Keg lies on the ground at one of several spots in the central and northern Barrens, most of them by the roads around the Crossroads; once someone takes it, it turns up at another. Brewmaster Drohn in Ratchet pays 250 Orgrimmar reputation for the keg and its first filling, then 50 for every filling after, as often as you like (10 at a fifth).
  collect 4926 @55.7,27.3              -- Chen's Empty Keg: look for it by the roads
  accept 819 item 4926                -- Chen's Empty Keg, +100

step Ratchet: Brewmaster Drohn
  when done keg
  turnin 819                          -- Brewmaster Drohn
  accept 821                          -- Chen's Empty Keg, +150

step Lions, plainstriders and a thunder lizard
  when done keg
  tip Savannah lions, plainstriders and thunder lizards roam the whole northern Barrens. The lions drop a tusk about every other kill, the plainstriders a kidney about two kills in five; any thunder lizard may drop the horn, about one in five.
  collect 4893 x5 quest 821.1         -- Savannah Lion Tusk
  collect 4894 x5 quest 821.2         -- Plainstrider Kidney
  collect 4895 quest 821.3            -- Thunder Lizard Horn

step Ratchet: the repeatable keg
  when done keg
  tip From now on Drohn takes 5 Lightning Glands, a Thunderhawk Saliva Gland and a Kodo Liver for 50, as often as you like. The Stormhide thunder lizards (a gland about every other kill), the Greater Thunderhawks and the kodos south of Camp Taurajo drop them. Gather several sets before you head back to Ratchet.
  turnin 821                          -- Brewmaster Drohn
  collect 4898 x5 optional            -- Lightning Gland, from Stormhides
  collect 4897 optional               -- Thunderhawk Saliva Gland, from Greater Thunderhawks
  collect 4896 optional               -- Kodo Liver, from the kodos
