step Rashona Straglash: A Donation of Wool
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip From here it is cloth. Wool, Silk and Mageweave must all be handed in before Rashona offers the Runecloth donation, and Additional Runecloth needs the Runecloth donation. Buy cloth at the Auction House, or farm it: humanoids drop it, Wool from level 15 to 25, Silk 25 to 40, Mageweave 40 to 50, Runecloth 50 and up. At 60 farm mobs of level 52 or more: lower ones are grey.
  zone Ashenvale
  collect 2592 x60 quest 7826.1 @36,37      -- Wool Cloth: the Thistlefur furbolgs drop it about one kill in four
  turnin 7826                         -- Rashona Straglash, +150

