step Additional Runecloth to Honored
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Additional Runecloth: 20 Runecloth for 50 reputation, as often as you like. Friendly to Honored is 6,000: 120 hand-ins, 2,400 Runecloth, less what the quests gave you (an orc starts at Friendly 1,000: 100 hand-ins; an Undead or Skyborne starts at Neutral 2,000 and first needs 20 hand-ins, 400 Runecloth, to reach Friendly). Hand in every 20 you carry, one after another.
  collect 14047 x20 optional live @68,69.5 -- Runecloth: the Scarlet outside Tyr's Hand
  turnin 7832 direct optional         -- Rashona Straglash: Additional Runecloth, +50
  rep 76 Honored

step Additional Runecloth to Revered
  tip Honored to Revered is 12,000: 240 hand-ins, 4,800 Runecloth. The Auction House price of a stack decides whether to farm or buy.
  collect 14047 x20 optional live @68,69.5 -- Runecloth
  turnin 7832 direct optional         -- Additional Runecloth, +50
  rep 76 Revered

step Additional Runecloth to Exalted
  tip Revered to Exalted is 21,000: 420 hand-ins, 8,400 Runecloth. Raid heads pay too: The Lord of Blackrock (Nefarian) 200 to every Horde city and Victory for the Horde (Onyxia) 400 to Orgrimmar. At Exalted, Ogunaro Wolfrunner in the Valley of Honor sells the wolves to every Horde race: 20 gold for a level 40 wolf, 200 gold for a swift wolf at level 60 (Forever's prices); in Classic other races needed Exalted to buy them.
  collect 14047 x20 optional live @68,69.5 -- Runecloth
  turnin 7832 direct optional         -- Additional Runecloth, +50
  rep 76 Exalted
  talk 3362 optional                  -- Ogunaro Wolfrunner: the wolves
